WEBVTT

00:40:58.167 --> 00:41:01.893
EP: So how did you learn to tolerate
conflict, tension, disagreement?

00:41:01.917 --> 00:41:05.476
AG: I think it started
probably in relationships

00:41:05.500 --> 00:41:08.059
where I felt like there was a secure base

00:41:08.083 --> 00:41:10.518
that I didn't have to question
whether, you know,

00:41:10.542 --> 00:41:12.434
if I hurt the person's feelings

00:41:12.458 --> 00:41:15.976
or I said something
that might be a little bit challenging,

00:41:16.000 --> 00:41:17.976
that it wouldn't damage the relationship

00:41:18.000 --> 00:41:20.143
because the relationship
was either so strong

00:41:20.167 --> 00:41:22.684
or they were secure
enough in their own ego

00:41:22.708 --> 00:41:26.684
that they weren't going
to be insulted by it.

00:41:26.708 --> 00:41:29.309
I probably overcorrected on that
at some point though,

00:41:29.333 --> 00:41:32.226
and decided that anytime
I have a relationship with someone,